This TypeScript project was scaffolded with `a2a init --language typescript`.
It declares a native `A2AAgent`, compiles that declaration to
`.a2a/agent.dsl.json`, and runs a small localhost worker that the common A2A
sidecar invokes.

## Local Setup

```bash
npm install
npm run compile
npm run worker
```

`npm run compile` writes `.a2a/agent.dsl.json`. The deployed container starts
`node dist/worker.js` beside `a2a sidecar`; the public A2A/MCP endpoints are
served by the sidecar.

## Deploy

```bash
a2a deploy
```

Deploy compiles the DSL, uploads source, and lets the control plane choose the
TypeScript sidecar build image.
